{"last_link_id": 18, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["# ComfyUI-VoxCPM\n\n**VoxCPM**  a novel tokenizer-free TTS system for context-aware speech generation and true-to-life voice cloning.\n\n## Models\nThis node automatically downloads the required model files.\n\n| Model | Parameters | Hugging Face Link |\n|:---|:---:|:---|\n| VoxCPM-0.5B | 0.5B | [openbmb/VoxCPM-0.5B](https://huggingface.co/openbmb/VoxCPM-0.5B) |\n\n## Support \n\n- Don't know how to update PyTorch?\n- Need help with ComfyUI?\n- Need technical support?\n\n### Or do you just have questions? Then join the [@TokenDiffusion Hub](https://t.me/TokenDiff_hub) group\n\n### AI news [TokenDiffusion](https://t.me/TokenDiff)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [311.074462890625, 346.9256286621094], "pos": [-939.8861083984375, -702.8184814453125], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [396.5276794433594, 193.39329528808594], "pos": [-1008.1236572265625, -1048.589599609375], "widgets_values": ["audio/VoxCPM"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 10, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.52", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"filename_prefix": true, "audioUI": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "Generated Audio", "links": [10], "label": "Generated Audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "Generated Audio"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["VoxCPM-0.5B", "哎呀，大师兄，不好咯！师父又遭妖怪抓起跑咯！这回是哪个批妖孽哦，黑黢黢的一坨，扛着师父‘嗖’一下就没得影儿咯！我追得屁儿翻天，结果一跟头栽到田头，啃了一嘴泥巴！师父在那儿喊：‘八戒救我！’我救个铲铲哦，我自身都难保！你还不赶紧翻你的筋斗云，拿你的金箍棒，去给他两坨子！再慢点，师父就要被蒸起、煮起、红烧起咯！老子肚皮都饿扁咯，还等你打妖妖，打完回去吃斋饭！快点儿哦，猴哥，我屁儿都冒烟咯！", 2, 20, true, 632988508629981, "randomize", false, "cuda", "你啷个哦？吃了没得？搞啥子哦？安逸得很！巴适得板！慌个锤子！瓜娃子！你黑得很！莫得事！走嘛！"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "prompt_audio", "link": 12, "label": "prompt_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "prompt_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 14, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_value"}, "name": "cfg_value", "label": "cfg_value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_value"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_timesteps"}, "name": "inference_timesteps", "label": "inference_timesteps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "inference_timesteps"}, {"widget": {"name": "normalize_text"}, "name": "normalize_text", "label": "normalize_text", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "normalize_text"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_offload"}, "name": "force_offload", "label": "force_offload", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "force_offload"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_text"}, "shape": 7, "name": "prompt_text", "link": 18, "label": "prompt_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "VoxCPM_TTS", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [399.0082702636719, 531.7355346679688], "pos": [-1438.1444091796875, -1058.956787109375], "id": 5, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VoxCPM_TTS"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["文本"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [-2824.794189453125, -969.703857421875], "id": 10, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## 🎤 Achieving High-Quality Voice Clones\n\nTo achieve the best voice cloning results, providing an accurate `prompt_text` is **critical**. This text acts as a transcript that aligns the sound of the `prompt_audio` with the words being spoken, teaching the model the speaker's unique vocal characteristics.\n\n### How to Use `prompt_text` Effectively\n\n#### 1. **Provide a Verbatim Transcript**\nThe `prompt_text` must be a word-for-word transcript of the `prompt_audio`. Do not summarize or describe the audio.\n\n✅ **Correct:** `The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.`\n\n❌ **Incorrect:** `A person saying a sentence about a fox.`\n\n#### 2. **Punctuation is Important**\nUse accurate punctuation to capture the speaker's intonation. The model learns how the speaker ends sentences, asks questions, or shows excitement.\n\n-   **For a statement:** `This is a great example.`\n-   **For a question:** `Is this a great example?`\n-   **For excitement:** `This is a great example!`\n\n#### 3. **Match Audio and Text Length**\nThe audio clip should be long enough to capture the speaker's natural pacing and rhythm.\n\n👍 **Good:** A 5-15 second clip of continuous, clear speech.\n\n👌 **Okay:** A 3-5 second clip.\n\n⚠️ **Warning:** Very short clips (< 3 seconds) may result in a less stable or robotic-sounding clone.\n\n\n> **Note:**\n> For the best results, use a clean, high-quality `prompt_audio` with minimal background noise, reverb, or music. The model will try to clone the *entire* acoustic environment, not just the voice."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [324.9739685058594, 549.7145385742188], "pos": [-1676.7099609375, -437.5083312988281], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["参考音频文案，要求一样！"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [-2789.230712890625, -554.125], "id": 9, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [12], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [350.4437255859375, 136], "pos": [-2239.982177734375, -1219.458740234375], "widgets_values": ["fbdefd9f26913682e9e4721c0592511a73e8e6f1145e585ed11210df02431b53.MP3", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "LoadAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.52", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"upload": true, "audio": true, "audioUI": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadAudio"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [14], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-2586.954833984375, -969.206787109375], "widgets_values": ["开局千万别先建家，别看建家资源丰富，土地辽阔，可一旦蜘蛛虫潮入侵，那可是防不胜防\n新手一定开局先要捉虫驯化，只要能驯化不同的昆虫，就能组建强大的军队来守卫巢穴保护蚁后，剿灭来势汹汹的蜘妹军团，解锁新的资源地，坐收大把资源\n接下来升级扩张蚁穴，就能抓更高级的昆虫，挑战更高级的资源地，称霸微观世界轻轻松松啦"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "li